    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create. Hatch. Battle. Evolve.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve Monster Infinite</strong> is a <strong>turn-based roguelike monster battler</strong> where your imagination is the ultimate weapon! Draw your own creatures and let powerful AI bring them to life\u2014then hatch them into monsters with unique stats, skills, and traits based on your artistic style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're sketching a fearsome beast or a cute little blob, <strong>every line matters</strong>. Each drawing becomes a one-of-a-kind monster that reflects your creativity\u2014and evolves alongside your strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Draw to Create, Hatch to Battle</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use in-game tools to <strong>draw your own monster designs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced AI transforms your drawing into a <strong>fully animated monster</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your drawing directly influences <strong>attributes, typing, and skills</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch your monster from an egg and start your evolutionary journey</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Strategic Turn-Based Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a <strong>custom team</strong> of monsters to explore rogue-style maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master turn-based battles with <strong>synergy-driven skills</strong> and counters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat other teams, earn resources, and <strong>mutate your monsters</strong> for the next run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is a chance to learn, adapt, and get stronger</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf10 Train, Trade, and Compete</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade monsters and eggs</strong> with other players in an open marketplace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover rare traits, exclusive skills, and secret evolutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the global leaderboard to prove you're the <strong>#1 monster trainer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join seasonal events, tournaments, and <strong>community challenges</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea Infinite Evolution Awaits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two monsters are ever the same. Your choices, your drawings, your battles\u2014everything you do reshapes your team. Become the ultimate trainer in a world where <strong>art meets AI</strong>, and strategy meets infinite possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to turn your imagination into unstoppable monsters?</strong><br>Hatch your first creation in <strong>Evolve Monster Infinite</strong>\u2014and evolve your legacy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create. Hatch. Battle. Evolve.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve Monster Infinite</strong> is a <strong>turn-based roguelike monster battler</strong> where your imagination is the ultimate weapon! Draw your own creatures and let powerful AI bring them to life\u2014then hatch them into monsters with unique stats, skills, and traits based on your artistic style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're sketching a fearsome beast or a cute little blob, <strong>every line matters</strong>. Each drawing becomes a one-of-a-kind monster that reflects your creativity\u2014and evolves alongside your strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Draw to Create, Hatch to Battle</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use in-game tools to <strong>draw your own monster designs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced AI transforms your drawing into a <strong>fully animated monster</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your drawing directly influences <strong>attributes, typing, and skills</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch your monster from an egg and start your evolutionary journey</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Strategic Turn-Based Combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a <strong>custom team</strong> of monsters to explore rogue-style maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master turn-based battles with <strong>synergy-driven skills</strong> and counters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat other teams, earn resources, and <strong>mutate your monsters</strong> for the next run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is a chance to learn, adapt, and get stronger</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf10 Train, Trade, and Compete</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade monsters and eggs</strong> with other players in an open marketplace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover rare traits, exclusive skills, and secret evolutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the global leaderboard to prove you're the <strong>#1 monster trainer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join seasonal events, tournaments, and <strong>community challenges</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea Infinite Evolution Awaits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two monsters are ever the same. Your choices, your drawings, your battles\u2014everything you do reshapes your team. Become the ultimate trainer in a world where <strong>art meets AI</strong>, and strategy meets infinite possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to turn your imagination into unstoppable monsters?</strong><br>Hatch your first creation in <strong>Evolve Monster Infinite</strong>\u2014and evolve your legacy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
